        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>做题时的意识 - 笔记页 5/9</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #cfcfcf;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .page-wrapper {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 620px;\n    background: #fbfbf9;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\n    padding: 25px 22px 40px 55px;\n    transform: rotate(-0.4deg);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* Purple pen clip at top */\n  .pen-clip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -14px;\n    right: 40px;\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 26px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8a2f7a, #6d1f63);\n    border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n\n  /* left edge sticky-note / bleed-through fragments */\n  .left-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-right: 1px dashed #ccc;\n  }\n  .frag {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #999;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n    left: 2px;\n  }\n  .tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n  .tab.blue { background: #4a6fb0; top: 60px; }\n  .tab.yellow { background: #e8d24a; top: 140px; }\n  .tab.pink { background: #d98fb3; top: 230px; }\n  .tab.gray-star { background: #8888a8; top: 330px; }\n\n  .content {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .star {\n    color: #e8b800;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .num {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background-color: #f7e26b;\n  }\n\n  .hl-green {\n    background-color: #b7e6b0;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  .frag1 { top: 18px; }\n  .frag2 { top: 55px; }\n  .frag3 { top: 95px; }\n  .frag4 { top: 135px; }\n  .frag5 { top: 175px; }\n  .frag6 { top: 215px; }\n  .frag7 { top: 255px; }\n  .frag8 { top: 300px; }\n  .frag9 { top: 345px; }\n  .frag10 { top: 400px; }\n  .frag11 { top: 450px; }\n  .frag12 { top: 500px; }\n  .frag13 { top: 560px; }\n  .frag14 { top: 610px; }\n  .frag15 { top: 660px; }\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-wrapper\">\n\n  <div class=\"pen-clip\"></div>\n\n  <!-- faint bleed-through text fragments from underlying page / sticky notes, left edge -->\n  <div class=\"left-strip\">\n    <div class=\"tab blue\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tab yellow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tab pink\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tab gray-star\">★</div>\n\n    <div class=\"frag frag1\">of few years.</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag2\">policies</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag3\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag4\">wage labor</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag5\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag6\">C.S</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag7\">诉</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag8\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag9\">s skills</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag10\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag11\">source...</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag12\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag13\">ed by...</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag14\">sources</div>\n    <div class=\"frag frag15\">[illegible]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"intro\">做题时，要有这个意识。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">28、</span>就某个词或者某个句子设问题，不用猜词。就一条，文章主旨！不用去研究这个词什么意思，把握主旨即可。全文主旨和段落主旨（前者更重要）。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">29、</span>接着28条说，不管什么题型，上面说的还是其他别的题型，很想对的说，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">反映主旨的</span>肯定对，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">前提是你能确定它就是主旨。</span>所以，文章读不太懂，但能把握作者想表达的意思即可。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★</span><span class=\"num\">30、</span><span class=\"hl-yellow\">注意中心句（即题眼）和前后句之间的关系，是接着说的，还是转折关系。</span>这里出题的话，要把握和前后句之间的关系。是并列关系的，可以从这些句子里找同义词，是转折关系的，就通过转折关系句子里的关键词的相反意思来判断。前提是你读不懂的情况下。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★</span><span class=\"num\">31、</span>凡是举例的，都是为了说明观点的。那么，这个观点（中心句），一般来说，会在举例之前就表达了。但有时候也在举例之后。总之，作者举例想说明的这个观点，你一定要找出来。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★</span><span class=\"num\">32、</span>排除2个选项以后，选出和文章主旨相关的选项即可。不知道主旨就把握关键词。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★</span><span class=\"num\">33、</span>词汇题的正确答案，<span class=\"hl-green\">往往隐藏在原文的读处附近（就是那个同义替换词）</span>，原文这附近的句子，是并列关系或者解释说明句的，就从这些句子的关键词的相近意思去把握。是转折关系的，就从关键词的相反意思去把握。总之，你要找的就是那个关键词。和30条一起理解吧。。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★</span><span class=\"num\">34、</span>如果原文中出现\"A is B and C\"。若某一问题，选项中出现了B没C，或者只出现C没B。肯定错，直接排除。可能你会问了，同时出现B and C咋办？目前还没出现过这种情况。注意，这里说的B和C，是单词或者短语。。这是干扰项的特点之一。实际情况，这个句子不是题眼。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">35、</span>接34说，还一种情况是，若B和C是2个长句子，中间用分号隔开的，且这两个\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">5/9</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
